WEBVTT

00:04:30.599 --> 00:04:34.520
Erotic audio stories
have characters and plot,

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:39.066
but like the sounds you just heard
create a blueprint for your mind

00:04:39.066 --> 00:04:40.693
to then fill in the blanks.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:44.322
They allow you to develop
your own vision of what's appealing

00:04:44.322 --> 00:04:45.740
in a way that can get lost

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:49.994
when you see something specific
or explicit onscreen.

00:04:51.412 --> 00:04:53.289
You may not be ready or interested

00:04:53.331 --> 00:04:55.583
in dipping a toe
into erotic audio stories.

00:04:55.624 --> 00:04:56.876
And that's OK.

00:04:56.917 --> 00:04:58.961
So today I'm going to walk you through

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:01.422
how you might get started
creating your own stories